    <item>
      <title>ITALY PREDICTED XI | EURO 2024 fantasy tips | Matchday 1</title>
      <description>Arguably the most difficult XI to predict at Euro 2024. Will Barella be fit? If not who replaces him? Why Scamacca and Buongiorno will start and will it be Cambiaso or Darmian? It all depends on where Di Lorenzo plays as Italy lines up with a front 5 back 5 in a 3-5-2 formation.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 08:00:00 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
      <itunes:author>The Gianni Buttice FPL Podcast</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
