    <item>
      <title>ITALY PREVIEW | PREDICTED XI | EURO 2024</title>
      <description>A team in transition, Luciano Spalletti has only been in charge for 9 months and already used an abundance of players and 3 different formations which makes predicting his starting XI so difficult.

There are arguably only 6 locks in this team; Donnarumma, Bastoni, Di Marco, Jorginho, Barella and Chiesa which now could setup in a 3-5-2.

Euro's mini league: 7Enshi

